// ---- src/ships/hammerhead.js ----
// Hammerhead-class corvette (Sphyrna-class), measured from the STL file the
// user supplied (HammerheadClassCorvette.STL; no author or licence came with
// it). Ship frame: x from the stern (0) to the bow (116.7 m, the canon length
// from the Rogue One production list), y up from the lowest point (the prow's
// lower edge), z to starboard. The hull is fitted station by station: a thread
// between the three engine nacelles, a core inside the stern plate and the
// engine block, the cylindrical main hull and the hammer prow plate ending in
// the prow spike. The nacelles, the Y-shaped engine block, the transverse
// drums, the turret base and pillar, the dorsal and ventral fittings of the
// main hull, the cockpit band, the swept upper edge and fins of the prow and
// the reinforced leading edges (armour plate) are structures measured from
